{#- The full system message for a scene turn — chat, retry, regenerate,
    director note, and (with the opener instruction leading) the scene opener.

    This template used to `include` all two dozen section templates itself and
    drop the empty ones, which made it a second render path over the same data:
    the prompt came from here, the inspector's token breakdown came from
    `context._SECTIONS`, and nothing held the two in step. A packer that drops
    a section under budget pressure turns that gap into a lie about what was
    sent, so the sections are now rendered once in code
    (`context.assemble._render_sections`), packed (`context.pack`), and joined
    here.

    Vars:
      sections ([str]) — the rendered, non-empty, packed section texts in
                         prompt order. The opener instruction, when there is
                         one, is simply the first of them.

    Note: {{user}}/{{char}} token substitution is applied by code to the card
    and history data, not here. -#}
{{ sections | join("\n\n") }}
